Package: zwiftverse
Title: Tidy httr2 Clients for the Zwift, ZwiftPower and ZwiftRacing.app APIs
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nick", "Plummer", , "nickplummer@cantab.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reverse-engineered, unofficial R clients for three Zwift-ecosystem
    APIs: the Zwift game API (us-or-rly101.zwift.com), ZwiftPower and
    ZwiftRacing.app. Typed wrappers return tibbles; low-level accessors reach
    unwrapped endpoints; an on-disk TTL cache avoids re-fetching stable data.
    None of these are official APIs - they are reverse-engineered and may break
    on any upstream change.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/nickopotamus/zwiftverse,
    https://nickopotamus.github.io/zwiftverse/
BugReports: https://github.com/nickopotamus/zwiftverse/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    httr2,
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite,
    knitr,
    pkgdown,
    rmarkdown,
    rvest,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tidyr,
    withr,
